# The main_v1 blind labeller outputs, frozen before the founder review (contract K14): two
# independent tool-less Claude passes, one agent per queue chunk per pass; the orchestrator wrote each
# raw CSV from the agent's structured output. The last two lines are the imported pass files.
# Labels built from these passes are model-labelled, two independent blind passes, disagreements retained as unresolved.
